From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bepok <wojtekjakubiszyn@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:38:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] ARM: dts: sun8i: a33: ga36: reserve a ramoops region

The board's only console is USB, so a crash before the gadget is up leaves no log. Reserve a ramoops region for pstore. On the V1.0 board it did not survive the panic reset; it is kept for retesting on other revisions and reset paths. Not for upstream: kept in r36s-a33-ga36-debian only.

Signed-off-by: Bepok <wojtekjakubiszyn@gmail.com>
---
 .../sun8i-a33-gameconsole-r36s-ga36.dts       | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/boot/dts/allwinner/sun8i-a33-gameconsole-r36s-ga36.dts b/arch/arm/boot/dts/allwinner/sun8i-a33-gameconsole-r36s-ga36.dts
index d433c2b..77460b0 100644
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/allwinner/sun8i-a33-gameconsole-r36s-ga36.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/allwinner/sun8i-a33-gameconsole-r36s-ga36.dts
@@ -143,6 +143,25 @@ speaker_amp: audio-amplifier {
 		sound-name-prefix = "Speaker Amp";
 	};
 
+	reserved-memory {
+		#address-cells = <1>;
+		#size-cells = <1>;
+		ranges;
+
+		/*
+		 * Crash log for /sys/fs/pstore: the board's only console is USB. It did not
+		 * survive the panic reset on V1.0; kept for retesting on other revisions.
+		 * Below U-Boot (0x4a000000) and above the FEL load area.
+		 */
+		ramoops@49000000 {
+			compatible = "ramoops";
+			reg = <0x49000000 0x100000>;
+			record-size = <0x20000>;
+			console-size = <0x20000>;
+			no-map;
+		};
+	};
+
 };
 
 &codec {
